OL,3,GNEWSABreak-in has 'real human impact'
OL,4,Aon small business
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of an island food kiosk and
OL,7,Fpizza truck says her team is "shaken"
OL,8,Fafter the business was targeted by
OL,9,Fcriminals.
OL,11,FMim's World said an attempt was made to
OL,12,Fforce entry into its kiosk at Cobo,
OL,13,FGuernsey, in the early hours of Tuesday
OL,14,Fand their pizza truck was broken into
OL,15,Fwith cash taken and oil poured inside
OL,16,Fthe van.
OL,18,FGuernsey Police said it was
OL,19,Finvestigating and urging people with
OL,20,Finformation to get in contact.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
